{"questionId":"u13-s006-v001","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"下列何者是一元二次方程式的標準式？","givenConditions":"a、b、c 為常數。","target":"辨認標準式定義","choices":["ax+b=0，a≠0","ax²+bx+c=0，a≠0","ax³+bx+c=0，a≠0","ax²+bx+c=0，a=0"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"確認只有 x 一個未知數；最高次 2 且 a≠0，所以答案為「ax²+bx+c=0，a≠0」。 標準式還要求等號右側為零；若二次項係數等於零，最高次便降為一次或更低，因此不能只因式中出現平方符號就判為二次方程式。","steps":["確認只有 x 一個未知數","最高次 2 且 a≠0","確認等號一側為零，且二次項係數不會使最高次退化。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"ax+b=0，a≠0","truth":false,"reason":"這是一次方程式。"},{"choice":"ax²+bx+c=0，a≠0","truth":true,"reason":"最高次為 2 且二次項係數不能為 0。"},{"choice":"ax³+bx+c=0，a≠0","truth":false,"reason":"最高次為 3。"},{"choice":"ax²+bx+c=0，a=0","truth":false,"reason":"會退化，最高次不再為 2。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"忽略 a≠0 或最高次 必須同時檢查未知數個數、最高次與二次項係數不為零。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":50,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"標準式條件完整。","difficultyReason":"定義辨認。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"辨認標準式定義","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"0eb05aa085ce2b37805b75e5ff17f891f2166d6269242966ea4d39df0d3ee61a"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v002","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"3x²-2x+7=0 的 a、b、c 為何？","givenConditions":"右邊為 0。","target":"讀出係數","choices":["a=3，b=2，c=7","a=-3，b=-2，c=7","a=3，b=-2，c=-7","a=3，b=-2，c=7"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"方程式已為標準式；讀得 3、-2、7，所以答案為「a=3，b=-2，c=7」。 各係數要連同前面的正負號讀取；一次項是負二倍未知數，所以其係數為負二，常數七在等號左側且未移項，仍為正七。","steps":["方程式已為標準式","讀得 3、-2、7","依平方項、一次項、常數項順序連同符號逐項核對。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"a=3，b=2，c=7","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉 b 的負號。"},{"choice":"a=-3，b=-2，c=7","truth":false,"reason":"誤把等號前視為負。"},{"choice":"a=3，b=-2，c=-7","truth":false,"reason":"常數符號錯。"},{"choice":"a=3，b=-2，c=7","truth":true,"reason":"依 x²、x、常數逐項讀係數並保留符號。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"忽略負號 一次項與常數項的係數都要連同其前方符號抄錄。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":50,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"係數唯一。","difficultyReason":"基本係數辨認。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"讀出係數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"1387c35810785a2c0e5b47758df4dcf7f0470bc85fef5e24441af20886856ecf"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v003","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"將 2x(x-3)=5 整理成標準式，何者正確？","givenConditions":"所有項移到同一邊。","target":"整理乘積方程式","choices":["2x²-6x-5=0","2x²-3x-5=0","2x²-6x+5=0","2x²-6x=0"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"展開 2x(x-3)=2x²-6x；減 5 得 2x²-6x-5=0，所以答案為「2x²-6x-5=0」。 外層二倍未知數須分配給括號內兩項，得到二倍平方項與負六倍一次項；再把右側五移到左側成負五，三項次數依序排列後即為標準式。","steps":["展開 2x(x-3)=2x²-6x","減 5 得 2x²-6x-5=0","按二次、一次、常數順序排列，逐項回代原等式驗證。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"2x²-6x-5=0","truth":true,"reason":"先展開 2x²-6x，再把 5 移到左邊。"},{"choice":"2x²-3x-5=0","truth":false,"reason":"分配律漏乘 x 或 2。"},{"choice":"2x²-6x+5=0","truth":false,"reason":"移項常數符號錯。"},{"choice":"2x²-6x=0","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉原方程式右端 5。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"分配律或移項錯 分配律要乘括號每一項，右側常數移項後也必須改號。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":65,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"可選整體乘 -1 的等價式，但本題選項指定形式。","difficultyReason":"展開與移項。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"整理乘積方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"f9f3379092f03396af8da5a998b4f56dc485408baac63a3d4aa8aebe6a716aad"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v004","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"將 4-3x=x² 整理成二次項係數為正的標準式。","givenConditions":"要求二次項係數為正。","target":"依指定形式整理標準式","choices":["x²-3x+4=0","-x²-3x+4=0","x²+3x-4=0","x²+3x+4=0"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"由 4-3x=x² 得 0=x²+3x-4；改寫為 x²+3x-4=0，所以答案為「x²+3x-4=0」。 把左側四與負三倍未知數移到右側後，分別變成負四與正三倍未知數；改寫等號方向不改各項符號，首項係數一為正，符合題目指定形式。","steps":["由 4-3x=x² 得 0=x²+3x-4","改寫為 x²+3x-4=0","檢查二次項係數為正，並代回確認等式與原式等價。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x²-3x+4=0","truth":false,"reason":"移項符號不完整。"},{"choice":"-x²-3x+4=0","truth":false,"reason":"雖等價且是標準式，但二次項係數為負，不符合題目指定。"},{"choice":"x²+3x-4=0","truth":true,"reason":"把左邊所有項移到右邊，再以正二次項排列。"},{"choice":"x²+3x+4=0","truth":false,"reason":"常數符號錯。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"忽略題目要求 a>0 或符號錯 移項要逐項改號，改寫等號左右次序本身不會再改號。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"等價的負倍數不符合指定呈現。","difficultyReason":"含形式條件的整理。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"依指定形式整理標準式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"bf099bb7be695bc7dab3da7c1f825988ec0f6011537f066937adfb5d0ba4fcb7"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v005","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"(x+2)(x-5)=7 的標準式為何？","givenConditions":"等號右端 7 必須納入。","target":"整理兩括號方程式","choices":["x²-3x-3=0","x²+3x-17=0","x²-7x-10=0","x²-3x-17=0"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"展開 x²-3x-10=7；兩邊減 7 得 x²-3x-17=0，所以答案為「x²-3x-17=0」。 展開時兩個交叉項是負五倍與正二倍未知數，合併為負三倍，常數為負十；右側七再移到左側，常數成負十減七等於負十七。","steps":["展開 x²-3x-10=7","兩邊減 7 得 x²-3x-17=0","合併同類項並檢查常數負十與負七相加為負十七。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x²-3x-3=0","truth":false,"reason":"把 -10 與 7 相加錯。"},{"choice":"x²+3x-17=0","truth":false,"reason":"一次項符號錯。"},{"choice":"x²-7x-10=0","truth":false,"reason":"展開中間項錯。"},{"choice":"x²-3x-17=0","truth":true,"reason":"展開得 x²-3x-10=7，再移項。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"FOIL 中間項或常數移項錯 先正確合併兩個交叉項，再把等號右側七移項成負七。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":85,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"標準式係數唯一到非零倍數。","difficultyReason":"兩階段展開與移項。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"整理兩括號方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"92d2eacf8751abbd551f551a6ed6d0ecc39aa361e04d9dfe38f97dda58b05579"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v006","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"下列哪一個不是一元二次方程式？","givenConditions":"一元要求只有一個未知數。","target":"辨認「一元」條件","choices":["x²-9=0","x²+y-3=0","2x²+5x=0","(x-1)(x+1)=0"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"逐項檢查未知數數量與最高次；含 y 的選項有兩個未知數，所以答案為「x²+y-3=0」。 一元要求整個方程式只有一個未知數；含有另一個未指定為常數的字母時，就是二元方程式。其餘各式展開或整理後都只有未知數 x 且最高次為二。","steps":["逐項檢查未知數數量與最高次","含 y 的選項有兩個未知數","將乘積選項展開後再確認其仍只有 x 且最高次為二。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x²-9=0","truth":false,"reason":"只有 x，最高次 2。"},{"choice":"x²+y-3=0","truth":true,"reason":"含 x、y 兩個未知數，不是一元。"},{"choice":"2x²+5x=0","truth":false,"reason":"只有 x，a=2。"},{"choice":"(x-1)(x+1)=0","truth":false,"reason":"展開為 x²-1=0。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只看到 x² 就忽略另一未知數 看到平方項仍須掃描全式是否另含第二個未知數，不能只看最高次。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"括號形式可展開判斷。","difficultyReason":"概念分類。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"辨認「一元」條件","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"5545a0f9277700cf30e868b292bb3e34f55fe303ca0bf8f9b080ebfe3a4a744a"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v007","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"方程式 (k-1)x²+3x-4=0 為一元二次方程式時，k 的條件為何？","givenConditions":"a 只需非 0，不必為正。","target":"求保持二次的參數條件","choices":["k≠1","k=1","k>1","k≥0"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"要求 k-1≠0；解得 k≠1，所以答案為「k≠1」。 二次項係數只須不等於零，不必為正；因此排除使 k 減一等於零的唯一參數值。當 k 小於一時係數雖為負，最高次仍是二。","steps":["要求 k-1≠0","解得 k≠1","代入邊界值一確認二次項消失，其他參數皆保留二次項。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"k≠1","truth":true,"reason":"二次項係數 k-1 必須不為 0。"},{"choice":"k=1","truth":false,"reason":"此時只剩 3x-4=0，一次方程式。"},{"choice":"k>1","truth":false,"reason":"k<1 但不等於 1 也可。"},{"choice":"k≥0","truth":false,"reason":"k=1 仍被錯納。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把二次項係數誤要求為正 二次項係數可以為負，只需排除係數為零造成的退化。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"排除唯一值。","difficultyReason":"參數退化判斷。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求保持二次的參數條件","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"b1fff6a5820544ce8d45e856811c6b510ef196b4221d8533adb2c9b273b38fab"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v008","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"將 (1/2)x²-(3/4)x+1=0 化為整數係數且最大公因數為 1 的標準式。","givenConditions":"乘以非零常數不改解集。","target":"正規化分數係數標準式","choices":["x²-3x+4=0","2x²-3x+1=0","2x²-3x+4=0","4x²-6x+8=0"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"所有項乘 4；得到 2x²-3x+4=0，所以答案為「2x²-3x+4=0」。 分母二與四的最小公倍數是四，所以方程式每一項連同零都乘四，係數成二、負三、四；三者最大公因數為一，已是整數係數最簡形式。","steps":["所有項乘 4","得到 2x²-3x+4=0","確認三個整數係數沒有共同因數，排除仍可整體約分的選項。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x²-3x+4=0","truth":false,"reason":"x² 項只乘 2，未一致。"},{"choice":"2x²-3x+1=0","truth":false,"reason":"常數未乘 4。"},{"choice":"2x²-3x+4=0","truth":true,"reason":"整式乘 4 清除分母，係數 2、-3、4 無共同因數。"},{"choice":"4x²-6x+8=0","truth":false,"reason":"等價但係數仍有公因數 2，不符合最簡要求。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"清分母未作用全部項或未約公因數","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"題目指定整數係數最簡。","difficultyReason":"等價標準式與規格化。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"正規化分數係數標準式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"84a8ed2e7811e25f60cb41ef612ad52f58b2c1047e4ce3e7c5efb7c1fdef6fbb"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v009","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"若 ax²+bx+c=0 中 a=0，最準確的敘述為何？","givenConditions":"未給 b、c，不能再細分。","target":"說明 a≠0 的必要性","choices":["它一定沒有解","它不再是一元二次方程式","它一定有無限多解","仍可直接套求根公式"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"代入 a=0 得 bx+c=0；最高次不再為 2，所以答案為「它不再是一元二次方程式」。 代入後只可確定二次項消失，剩下的方程式可能是一元一次、矛盾式或恆等式，還要看另外兩個係數；因此不能一概斷定解數，只能確定它不再是二次方程式。","steps":["代入 a=0 得 bx+c=0","最高次不再為 2","區分方程式類型與解的個數，避免由退化直接猜解數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"它一定沒有解","truth":false,"reason":"若 b≠0，仍有一個一次方程式解。"},{"choice":"它不再是一元二次方程式","truth":true,"reason":"二次項消失，可能成為一次方程式、矛盾式或恆等式。"},{"choice":"它一定有無限多解","truth":false,"reason":"只有特定 b=c=0 才如此。"},{"choice":"仍可直接套求根公式","truth":false,"reason":"公式分母 2a=0，且類型已退化。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把退化情況一概判成某種解數","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":105,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"唯一必然結論是類型改變。","difficultyReason":"概念邊界與多情況分析。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"說明 a≠0 的必要性","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"2acfe2b47f1d677778f2700d730b22aaf3ee284dee7da6cb412ca7ff00e9ff53"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v010","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"一塊長方形場地寬 x 公尺、長 x+5 公尺，面積 84 平方公尺。標準式為何？","givenConditions":"x>0，但本題只問列式。","target":"由面積文字列標準式","choices":["x²+5=84","2x+5=84","x²-5x-84=0","x²+5x-84=0"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"列 x(x+5)=84；展開移項得 x²+5x-84=0，所以答案為「x²+5x-84=0」。 長方形面積等於寬乘長，因此列出未知寬乘未知寬加五等於八十四；展開後把八十四移到左側成負八十四，所得三項式才是等號右側為零的標準式。","steps":["列 x(x+5)=84","展開移項得 x²+5x-84=0","以公尺乘公尺得到平方公尺，檢查式子量綱與題意一致。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x²+5=84","truth":false,"reason":"漏乘 x。"},{"choice":"2x+5=84","truth":false,"reason":"把面積誤作長寬和。"},{"choice":"x²-5x-84=0","truth":false,"reason":"長度增加 5 的符號錯。"},{"choice":"x²+5x-84=0","truth":true,"reason":"面積關係 x(x+5)=84，移項即可。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"混用周長或差值 面積用長乘寬，不可誤用周長；常數移項後必須改號。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"x 與 x+5 為公尺，乘積為平方公尺。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"平方公尺來自兩個公尺量相乘。","difficultyReason":"從量的關係建立標準式。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為面積單位與長寬差是列出二次乘積的必要情境。","authoringIntent":"由面積文字列標準式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"68aee8968a77e9956c17856dd185290a9e011a0c9174d333be7a683194d3fa2e"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v011","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"某成本模型為 500+20n=2n²。化為整數係數且首項係數為正的最簡標準式為何？","givenConditions":"2 非 0。","target":"整理並約簡模型方程式","choices":["2n²+20n+500=0","n²-20n-500=0","n²-10n-250=0","n²+10n-250=0"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"移到右側：2n²-20n-500=0；除以 2 得 n²-10n-250=0，所以答案為「n²-10n-250=0」。 把一次項與常數項移到二次項同側後，係數依序是二、負二十、負五百；全式同除以正二時每一項都要除，得到首項係數一的最簡整數式。","steps":["移到右側：2n²-20n-500=0","除以 2 得 n²-10n-250=0","將最簡式整體乘二回查，應恢復移項後的三個係數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"2n²+20n+500=0","truth":false,"reason":"移項符號錯。"},{"choice":"n²-20n-500=0","truth":false,"reason":"只除二次項係數。"},{"choice":"n²-10n-250=0","truth":true,"reason":"移項得 2n²-20n-500=0，再整式除以 2。"},{"choice":"n²+10n-250=0","truth":false,"reason":"一次項符號錯。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"移項或整式除法不一致 移項後要整式同除公因數，不能只除二次項或漏改符號。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"等號兩邊皆為成本單位；n 為數量。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"要求最大公因數消去。","difficultyReason":"情境模型的標準化。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為成本與二次產出等式提供了必須整理的實際模型。","authoringIntent":"整理並約簡模型方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"54bf6edfd0c03ab1cca18e84405aeb8a03a6c4d033dd492f02899c1ab8755b25"}
{"questionId":"u13-s006-v012","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-standard-form","lockedSkillOrder":6,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"位移模型 s=15t-5t²，當 s=20 時，化為首項係數為 1 的標準式為何？","givenConditions":"t 為時間，題目只要求列式。","target":"依指定係數整理運動模型","choices":["t²-3t+4=0","t²+3t-4=0","5t²-15t+20=0","t²-3t-4=0"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"代入 s=20：20=15t-5t²；移項 -5t²+15t-20=0，再除 -5，所以答案為「t²-3t+4=0」。 代入位移值後，把所有項整理到同一側可得負五倍平方項、正十五倍一次項與負二十；全式除以負五時三個符號都反轉，首項係數才會成正一。","steps":["代入 s=20：20=15t-5t²","移項 -5t²+15t-20=0，再除 -5","把所得標準式乘回負五，確認與代入後原等式完全相同。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"t²-3t+4=0","truth":true,"reason":"20=15t-5t²，移項後除以 -5。"},{"choice":"t²+3t-4=0","truth":false,"reason":"移項與除負數符號錯。"},{"choice":"5t²-15t+20=0","truth":false,"reason":"等價但首項係數不是 1。"},{"choice":"t²-3t-4=0","truth":false,"reason":"常數除負數符號錯。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"除以負數時符號錯 全式除以負數時，每一項係數與常數都必須同時改號。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-square-root-method"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"模型已統一 s 與 t 的單位；標準化不改單位關係。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"首項係數指定為 1。","difficultyReason":"多步移項與負數縮放。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為位移模型與指定 s 值共同形成二次方程式。","authoringIntent":"依指定係數整理運動模型","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"ef57373635a9be4aae1299eb9b6a212ce98396ef62668546c8675cab22f4d2c0"}
